- `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-uji3m3e6/src/config/mod.rs` - Re-exports and module-level docs need updating to expose ConfigFormat
- `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-uji3m3e6/src/cli/commands/init.rs` - config_exists() and update_gitignore() need TOML awareness
- `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-uji3m3e6/Cargo.toml` - Add the toml crate dependency
- `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-uji3m3e6/src/config/merger.rs` - Reference only: understand the merge pipeline that remains unchanged

